Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: bfd/coff-rs6000.c
Line: 2178
Function: xcoff_write_armap_big
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: In the 32-bit symbol names loop, while (map[i].abfd == current_bfd) is used without ensuring i < orl_count. When i becomes orl_count, the next condition evaluation reads past the end of the map array.

